@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to add a city to the map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : receives the request and asks for the city name
    deactivate

     Employee -> System : type the city name, coordinates, number and postion (if wanted) of blocks
        activate System

    System --> Employee : receives the name, XY coordinates, number of blocks and position (if given),\n and shows the data and asks for confirmation

    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms data
    activate System

        System --> Employee : adds the city to the map
    deactivate System
@enduml